        "candidate_id": "C_e797e47ec37426c0_0",
        "edit": "Changed the sensitivity list of the always block from `always@ (clk)` to `always@ (clk or d)` so the combinational assignment `q = d` re-evaluates when `d` changes, eliminating the stale/latched value at cycle 0.",
